298.png/fZnSgukB0n6J_f6-KqRC1Y904awFac2YbYskd22LJHc\"/><figcaption>全球「最聰明學生」排名出爐　東亞稱霸前六席　香港名次高於英國（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"全球「最聰明學生」排名出爐　東亞稱霸前六席　香港名次高於英國（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194642004983025664134269.png/8VG8vxlD3IZxOdpay_l_n0emzOf-F_C3_hE3mv4RN5o\"/><figcaption>全球「最聰明學生」排名出爐　東亞稱霸前六席　香港名次高於英國（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"全球「最聰明學生」排名出爐　東亞稱霸前六席　香港名次高於英國（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194642007050948608458710.png/8L5RyEfne09ACMdHpOn1pSdAF2wNIqrtv-HkZL_h5GQ\"/><figcaption>全球「最聰明學生」排名出爐　東亞稱霸前六席　香港名次高於英國（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"全球「最聰明學生」排名出爐　東亞稱霸前六席　香港名次高於英國（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194641992177422336340652.png/kV0xn48IM20p7in0SeuvjPgmDmsjKURy6i9IfuovSH4\"/><figcaption>全球「最聰明學生」排名出爐　東亞稱霸前六席　香港名次高於英國（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>韓國考試防作弊出奇招！3度發災難警報抓手機　李在明下令改革</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T07:23:53.189524+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1518,"images":24,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T07:00:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T07:37:26.231038+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T07:17:24.956153+00:00","content_hash":"727e70fae2fe40790ec9d8cf167e95bb65beb2d296f4d81b47452a99eb22ff44","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}